<title>BELGIUM: Glaverbel sets results calendar.</title>
<headline>Glaverbel sets results calendar.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian glass maker Glaverbel SA, controlled by Japan's Asahi Glass Co Ltd, said on Tuesday it had set dates for the following events:</p>
<p>February 27: 1996 earnings (after the 1530 GMT close of bourse trade);</p>
<p>April 11: announcement on 1996 dividend and first quarter trends (after 1530 GMT);</p>
<p>May 28: annual shareholders meeting (1000 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
